{% comment %}
  Renders social icons.
  Accepts:
  - class: {String} a class to be added to the <ul> element (optional).
  - whatsapp_link: {String} when present, renders a WhatsApp icon after Instagram (optional).
    Pet do Duque: o Craft não tem campo nativo de WhatsApp nos ícones sociais; o link
    vem por parâmetro para não afetar os outros usos deste snippet (ex.: announcement-bar).
  - show_labels: {Boolean} when true, shows the network name next to the icon instead of
    keeping it visually hidden (optional). Pet do Duque: só o Instagram tem o rótulo
    visível implementado — é a única rede da loja; as demais seguem só com ícone.

  Usage:
  {% render 'social-icons',
    class: 'my-class'
  %}
{% endcomment %}

<ul class="list-unstyled list-social{% if class %} {{ class}}{% endif %}" role="list">
  {%- if settings.social_facebook_link != blank -%}
    <li class="list-social__item">
      <a href="{{ settings.social_facebook_link }}" class="link list-social__link">
        <span class="svg-wrapper">
          {{- 'icon-facebook.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </span>
        <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'general.social.links.facebook' | t }}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if settings.social_instagram_link != blank -%}
    <li class="list-social__item">
      <a href="{{ settings.social_instagram_link }}" class="link list-social__link">
        <span class="svg-wrapper">
          {{- 'icon-instagram.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </span>
        {%- if show_labels -%}
          <span class="list-social__label">{{ 'general.social.links.instagram' | t }}</span>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'general.social.links.instagram' | t }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>
    </li>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if whatsapp_link != blank -%}
    <li class="list-social__item">
      <a href="{{ whatsapp_link }}" class="link list-social__link">
        <span class="svg-wrapper">
          {{- 'icon-whatsapp.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </span>
        <span class="visually-hidden">WhatsApp</span>
      </a>
    </li>
  {%- endif -%}
